# Strict Python-source-only repository policy.
# Ignore everything by default, then explicitly re-allow only:
#   - this .gitignore file
#   - *.py files (in any directory, including nested ones)
*

!.gitignore
!*.py
!*/

# Explicit call-outs (already covered by the blanket "*" rule above,
# listed for clarity/documentation of intent). Root-anchored ("/name") so
# these only match the top-level directory of that name, never a same-named
# source subpackage elsewhere in the tree (e.g. src/data/ must stay tracked).
/.venv/
/venv/
/env/
/data/
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
